rned through fire, steel, and blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560140/extras/1294366d5a0a14fc1d63dce9a5bc4764.poster.avif?t=1763682182\" width=614 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560140/extras/1294366d5a0a14fc1d63dce9a5bc4764.webm?t=1763682182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f LOCAL MULTIPLAYER: CHOOSE YOUR ARMY. CHOOSE YOUR COLORS. CHOOSE YOUR DESTINY. \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War is not meant to be fought alone. Challenge your friends in intense local PvP battles. Pick your race, customize your army\u2019s colors, and wage war across battlefields built for pure destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One will rise. One will fall. Friendships could possibly end here. Gamepads will be BROKEN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a fight for supremacy\u2014a test of strategy, skill, and the will to dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will emerge victorious?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560140/extras/df2baf73a439a679ff236e0983186adc.poster.avif?t=1763682182\" width=614 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560140/extras/df2baf73a439a679ff236e0983186adc.webm?t=1763682182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf MINI-GAMES &amp; BOSS RUSH: CAN YOU SURVIVE? \ud83c\udfaf</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think the campaign was brutal? Think you\u2019ve mastered the battlefield? You haven\u2019t even seen the worst of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Boss Rush \u2013 Face the warlords back-to-back with no rest. Can you survive their wrath without breaking?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Mini-Games \u2013 Tests of skill, strategy, and absolute precision. Only the best will conquer them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angry Tusslin' Awesome Knights is more than a game. It is a challenge. It is a war. A medieval battlefield set in your room. It is your proving ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude78 DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES? \ud83e\ude78</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to emerge in a magical fantasy world that will treat you ruthlessly. Most will quit. Some will rage uninstall. A few, the strongest, the most relentless, will rise.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be one of them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will the ATAK of your opponents break you?</p>","developers":["3Z"],"dlc":[4120080],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560140/header.jpg?t=1763682182","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13 Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1560140/815268/894b0f2b0ddaf68460815d201c0a6fa533b4d4d2/1751003240/dash_av1.mpd?t=1737415083","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1560140/815268/894b0f2b0ddaf68460815d201c0a6fa533b4d4d2/1751003240/dash_h264.mpd?t=1737415083","highlight":tr